  "description": "An old and a new layer for code-update, in OGC:CRS84, simplified to 100 m. `nld_admin2_2022.parquet` has the 345 land gemeenten from the CBS Wijk- en Buurtkaart 2022, coded by code-create from root `NL`. `nld_admin2_2023.parquet` has the 342 land gemeenten of 2023 with only their CBS and Kadaster codes. Running code-update carries the 2022 codes forward: two mergers retire 5 codes and create 2, and the other 340 gemeenten keep theirs. See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).",
